---
title: Metrics Reporting Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Worker
    participant Collector as MetricsCollector
    participant EbpfMon as EbpfMonitor
    participant Store as EbpfMetricStore
    participant Scheduler
    participant DB as SchedulerDB

    Note over Worker,Scheduler: Every 2 seconds

    Worker->>Collector: collect()
    activate Collector
    Collector->>Collector: read /proc/stat (CPU)
    Collector->>Collector: read /proc/meminfo (memory)
    Collector->>Collector: read /proc/net/dev (network)
    Collector-->>Worker: WorkerMetricsData
    deactivate Collector

    Worker->>Scheduler: ReportWorkerMetrics(worker_id, cpu_%, memory_%, ...)
    activate Scheduler
    Scheduler->>DB: save_worker_metrics()
    Scheduler-->>Worker: accepted
    deactivate Scheduler

    EbpfMon->>EbpfMon: poll() → read BPF maps + cgroup files
    EbpfMon->>Store: add_snapshot(job_id, metrics)
    activate Store
    Store->>Store: store under lock
    deactivate Store

    Worker->>Store: drain(job_id)
    activate Store
    Store-->>Worker: buffered snapshots
    deactivate Store

    Worker->>Scheduler: ReportJobEbpfMetrics(worker_id, batch of snapshots)
    activate Scheduler
    Scheduler->>DB: save_ebpf_metrics()
    Scheduler-->>Worker: accepted
    deactivate Scheduler
